x to move because of pushing. And eventually the box will be pushed by a \"mysterious overwhelming impulse\" and fly far away from the ground. I guess that could be because the box was \"squeezed\" by both the character body and the static body (the ground) and its recovery was activated.\n\nEven if I tried `apply_force()`, when the player's `mass` is kept to `60kg` while the box's is set to `5kg`, the same issue goes again.\n\n<img width=\"679\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8163a335-8b99-47eb-b248-324a92ee5daf\" />\n\n<img width=\"1435\" height=\"358\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c584202-6647-4c2f-9f56-df75610380d4\" />\n\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7968bcd5-4a15-41e4-90ce-95707f960313\" controls=\"\" height=400 width=600> </video>\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCheck the MRP and run the test scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[entitybody.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24142495/entitybody.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users